  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>Overcharges the autoloader for a widespread burst of explosives.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Projectile Launch System Cyberware Enhancement.</strong> The PLS’s capacity is increased by 4 (5 Total Grenades/Rockets), but Reloading it takes an additional Action. While Combat Software (Launch Capacity Override) is installed, as an Action, the user can charge Launch Capacity Override. Their next Action must be a ROF 1 Attack using Launch Capacity Override, or else the charge is lost.</p>\n<p>When using Launch Capacity Override, the PLS expends 5 rounds of its loaded ammunition, functioning as a single Explosive attack over a 14 x 14m/yds area (7x7 squares). This deals the same amount of damage the fired ammunition would normally deal, but damage is re-rolled for every target afflicted. Dodging this attack is done at a -2 penalty.</p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Popup Grenade Launcher (Corgo's Projectile Launch System)<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The +4 capacity is applied automatically.</li>\n<li>Cyberpunk RED - Core 0.92.4 ships no Projectile Launch System item; its Popup Grenade Launcher is the same thing under another name, so install this into that.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Cyberarms).</em></p>"
  },
